- `*p == '['`. `bracket = memchr(p, ']', path_start - p)`. Found at the `]`.
- `*(bracket+1)` = `/`, not `:`. So `colon = NULL`.
- `hostend = path_start`. `parse_host(p, length, ...)`.
  - `*start == '['`. `start[length-1] == ']'`. OK.
  - `addr = g_strndup(start+1, length-2)` = `::1\xC3` (nul-terminated).
  - `pct = strchr(addr, '%')` = position 3.
  - `*pct = '\0'`. `addr` = `::1`.
  - `g_hostname_is_ip_address("::1")` = TRUE. `strchr("::1", ':')` = non-null. OK.
  - `*pct = '%'`. `addr` = `::1%\xC3`.
  - `strchr(pct+1, '%')` = `strchr("\xC3", '%')` = NULL. OK.
  - `pct[1]` = `\xC3`. `pct[1] == '2'`? No. So `memmove` not called.
  - `host = addr` = `::1%\xC3`.

Then `g_uri_to_string` is called. In `g_uri_join_internal`:
```c
